      "text": "MS on Rubin Timeline\n\n$nvda Rubin is on track: NVIDIA's first Rubin silicon should be out from the TSMC fab this October (first tape-out was in June). Meanwhile, our checks suggest NVIDIA's Rubin engineering sampling (ES) is on track for 4Q25, although the fine-tuning of the Rubin chip design continues. The chips and their system design should be finalized next March, with the chip entering mass production in 2Q26, followed by server racks ramp in 3Q26. So it appears there will be no delay to the Rubin schedule, despite some investor concerns.",
