      "text": "Please give Fubon\u2019s analyst credit. He did the channel checks and is reporting data. The alternative is for you to purchase @SemiAnalysis_  Accelerator Model. To me, this reads as glass half-full / half-empty for both $NVDA and $AMD. \n\nThis isn\u2019t the first delay, and a 3 months slip doesn\u2019t change the long-term thesis for $NVDA. Take a chill pill. The CoWoS figures still imply FY2027 revenue well above Street expectations. You should be questioning the Street instead. \n\nIt isn\u2019t particularly bullish for $AMD either. We\u2019ve seen higher CoWoS counts before that were later revised lower. Scale-up is still a big hurdle that remains unresolved. \n\nWe need less narrative and more math",
